# PKDB-Bench: set_operation instance
# Which scientists were both physicists (by occupation) AND Nobel Prize laureates
# (any Nobel category)? List each laureate-award-year row with the Nobel
# category and the laureate's country/countries of citizenship.
#
# Universe (deterministic, source-reproducible):
#   - persons whose Wikidata P106 (occupation) values include Q169470 (physicist)
#   - intersected with persons who have at least one P166 (award received)
#     statement whose value is an instance of Q7191 (Nobel Prize)
#   - filtered to award years 1901-2024 (the explicit pre-2025 LLM-knowable cutoff)
#
# Per `references/sparql-gotchas.md`:
#   §1: P166/P585 use the all-ranks `p:`/`ps:`/`pq:` paths so the year-qualifier
#   filter is explicit. P106 uses `wdt:` truthy because we want a person
#   classified as "currently a physicist" by Wikidata's occupation curation.
#   §3: the wikibase:label SERVICE clause is at the end of the WHERE block.
#   §3 extension: not every laureate has an English `rdfs:label` — most
#   famously, Marie Curie (Q7186) has only French and Polish rdfs:labels and
#   the wikibase:label SERVICE falls back to "Q7186" for her under this query
#   shape. The post-processor uses the English Wikipedia sitelink title as
#   the canonical Laureate name when rdfs:label@en is absent (Curie's
#   en.wikipedia.org sitelink title is "Marie Curie").
#
# Post-processor responsibilities (documented in _extraction_notes):
#   - prefer `rdfs:label@en`; fall back to the en.wikipedia.org sitelink
#     title (`schema:about` triple) when no English label exists; this
#     recovers Marie Curie and any future similarly-untagged laureates
#   - aggregate multi-citizenship rows into a single semicolon-delimited
#     "Country of Citizenship" cell per (Laureate, Year, Nobel Category)
#     using an alphabetical sort
#   - dedup on (Laureate, Year, Nobel Category)

SELECT DISTINCT ?person ?personEnLabel ?personSitelink ?nobelYear ?awardLabel ?countryLabel WHERE {
  ?person wdt:P106 wd:Q169470 .

  ?person p:P166 ?awardStmt .
  ?awardStmt ps:P166 ?award .
  ?award wdt:P31 wd:Q7191 .

  ?awardStmt pq:P585 ?yearVal .
  BIND(YEAR(?yearVal) AS ?nobelYear)
  FILTER(?nobelYear >= 1901 && ?nobelYear <= 2024)

  OPTIONAL { ?person wdt:P27 ?country . }

  OPTIONAL { ?person rdfs:label ?personEnLabel . FILTER(LANG(?personEnLabel) = "en") }
  OPTIONAL {
    ?article schema:about ?person ;
             schema:isPartOf <https://en.wikipedia.org/> ;
             schema:name ?personSitelink .
  }

  SERVICE wikibase:label { bd:serviceParam wikibase:language "en". }
}
ORDER BY ?nobelYear ?personEnLabel
